OL,3,GNEWSAFuller GCSE results breakdown
OL,4,Apossible in future
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore extensive details on GCSE results
OL,7,Fhave been promised in the future to
OL,8,Fhelp parents make "the best choice" for
OL,9,Ftheir children.
OL,11,FJersey's Education Minister Catherine
OL,12,FCurtis said more information could be
OL,13,Fgiven out as early as next year, but
OL,14,Femphasised there was more to a school's
OL,15,Fperformance than exam results.
OL,17,FCurrently, the island's government
OL,18,Fusually releases the overall pass rate,
OL,19,Fbut not a breakdown of how each school
OL,20,Fdid per subject.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
