OL,3,GNEWSAFuller GCSE results breakdown
OL,4,Apossible in future
OL,5,
OL,6,FSt Martin resident Alisdair Macleod
OL,7,Fsubmitted a Freedom of Information
OL,8,F(FoI) request to find out how Jersey
OL,9,Fschools performed in each subject as he
OL,10,Ffelt parents were "entitled" to know
OL,11,Fhow schools were doing.
